  "description": "Louise Ideana, a survivor of the fallen Ideana family, has been living in hiding as a maid. Then one day, Shayde Lupus, the slave she once sold, appears before her as a duke. Though Louise denies knowing him, Shayde has not forgotten her. With cold fury and lingering obsession, he makes it clear that he has no intention of letting her escape him again. As the woman who lost everything and the man who rose from nothing cross paths once more, their reunion is shadowed by power, resentment, and a past neither of them can escape.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
